# The global gitignore (~/.gitignore_global) excludes .github/** so that
# workflow files are not committed by accident. This site genuinely wants its
# workflows tracked, and a repo-level rule overrides the global one.
!.github/
!.github/workflows/
!.github/workflows/*.yml

# Screenshots dropped at the repo root to show someone a rendering problem.
# They have been committed by accident twice now (73032d2, and again during
# the gallery rework), which is often enough to just ignore them.
/Screenshot*.png
